- **Hazards learned the hard way this session:** MSYS `sed` silently fails on `v3\tools`-style
  backslash patterns and strips CRLF (`git show HEAD:` cannot detect it — use `git checkout-index`);
  **never `git checkout-index -f -a`**, it destroyed 9 uncommitted files (recovered from loose
  blobs `git add` had written); ReadOnly `docs/*.md` are DB-generated — edit via `set_canon_section`,
  and MCP writes need `switch_universe` first.
